# Security response headers for static hosts that support them (Netlify, Cloudflare Pages, etc.)
# NOTE: GitHub Pages ignores this file. If you host on GitHub Pages, set these as
# Cloudflare Response-Header Rules instead (see HOW-TO-EDIT.md, "Going live").
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()
# No HSTS template: audit all affected hosts and HTTPS before choosing its scope.
# A tested CSP header, including frame-ancestors, needs hosting/CDN approval.
